            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogw'amakumi ataano mu ebiri ogw'obufuzi bwa Azaliya kabaka wa Yuda, Peka mutabani wa Lemaliya n'alya obwakabaka bwa Isirayiri mu Samaliya, era n'afugira emyaka amakumi abiri.",
